# Line endings that must survive a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true): Git Bash scripts need LF.
*.sh            text eol=lf
*.jq            text eol=lf
.githooks/*     text eol=lf
# docs/catalog.md uses git's normal text merge on purpose: a union merge let a rebase bring back rows another lane had
# deleted, silently. Two lanes that edit the same catalog lines now get a conflict to resolve by hand.
